  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 372910ba12c054b2fa539157d2f28996, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u duy nh\u1EA5t: \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n
    hai bi c\xF9ng l\xFAc v\xE0 ch\u1EC9 th\u1EAFng khi c\u1EA3 hai \u0111\xE3 ra;
    ch\u01B0a c\xF3 c\xF4ng t\u1EAFc ho\u1EB7c gi\u1EEF t\u1EA3i. B\u1ED1 tr\xED:
    P02 + danh s\xE1ch hai bi c\u1EE7a P16 \u2014 s\xE0n m\u1EDF, b\u1ECF kh\u1ED1i
    c\u1EA3n, l\u1ED7 ti\u1EBFp c\u1EADn r\u1ED9ng.\nRecovery: Hai bi lu\xF4n c\xF3
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng t\u1EDBi l\u1ED7; bi tho\xE1t tr\u01B0\u1EDBc kh\xF4ng khi\u1EBFn
    bi c\xF2n l\u1EA1i m\u1EA5t \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n m\u1EDF \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng"
